  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction: </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">What sets our jewelry apart is not only its aesthetic appeal but also the thoughtfulness and intention behind each piece. We believe in celebrating individuality and offering jewelry that allows you to express your true self.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Product description:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Mid-tier Jewelry&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Includes Charms, Beads, Bracelets, Necklaces, Rings etc.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Most of our products made are 925 Sterling Silver with substainable lab-grown gemstones</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Some of our products will use 18k/14k Gold and other precious stones like Moissanite that comes with GRA Cert</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point): </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">When it comes to crafting our jewelry, we hold ourselves to the highest standards of quality and craftsmanship.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We pay meticulous attention to detail, ensuring that every element is perfect.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We prioritize using only the finest materials, sourced responsibly and ethically.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">From conflict-free gemstones to recycled metals, we strive to minimize our environmental impact while creating exquisite pieces that stand the test of time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>30 Days</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br><strong>Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<p>When you choose Charmadise, you can be confident that you are adorning yourself with jewelry that has been crafted with love, using high-quality materials and sustainable methods. Each piece becomes a symbol of your values and a statement of your commitment to making a positive impact on the world.<strong><br></strong></p>\r\n<p>Get to know us at: <a href=\"https://www.charmadise.com/pages/about-us\">https://www.charmadise.com/pages/about-us</a></p>",
